WEBVTT

00:00:12.466 --> 00:00:15.666
Hey there. My name's Lily.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.800
Do you ever lose things at school? I do.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:30.800
Let's see... Where are they? This isn't it.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:37.633
It's a pen. It's purple. Hmm...

00:00:38.866 --> 00:00:43.499
Whose pen is this? I know!

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.800
It's my friend Mia's pen.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:50.766
Purple is her favourite colour. It's hers.

00:00:52.066 --> 00:01:02.199
Let's see. Where are they? Oh! A calculator.

00:01:04.233 --> 00:01:05.866
Whose calculator is that?

00:01:07.466 --> 00:01:10.566
I think that's Mr. Smith's calculator.

00:01:10.566 --> 00:01:13.699
He's our teacher. It's his.

00:01:14.233 --> 00:01:20.366
And whose pencils are those? Oh, I know.

00:01:20.366 --> 00:01:23.299
They're Nick's pencils. They're his.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:29.600
Nick is my classmate. He loses his things all the time.

00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:39.799
Ah-ha! Here they are! Whose sunglasses are these? (ta-da!)

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:43.833
They're mine! Great!

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:50.433
And now I can tell Mia, Nick, and Mr. Smith where their things are!

00:01:50.433 --> 00:01:55.066
Remember. Don't lose your things at school! Bye!

00:01:59.133 --> 00:02:03.866
Oops! Bye again!

00:02:08.533 --> 00:02:10.933
Which language does the vlogger use?

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:22.866
When we want to ask about who things belong to, we say <i>Whose.</i>

00:02:24.666 --> 00:02:26.899
Whose sunglasses are these?

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:31.600
<i>They're mine. They're yours.</i>

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.433
Whose calculator is that?

00:02:37.933 --> 00:02:39.599
<i>It's his.</i>

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:43.566
Whose pencils are those?

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:48.466
<i>They're his.</i>

00:02:50.766 --> 00:02:52.366
Whose pen is this?

00:02:53.833 --> 00:02:57.633
<i>It's hers. It's ours. It's theirs.</i>

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.233
<b>Use it!</b>

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:08.233
Look and ask who the things belong to.

00:03:21.666 --> 00:03:24.232
<i><b>Whose </b>calculator is this?</i>

00:03:24.233 --> 00:03:25.266
<i>It's <b>hers.</b></i>

00:03:26.533 --> 00:03:28.099
<i>Now you try.</i>

00:03:38.466 --> 00:03:41.432
<i><b>Whose</b> pen is this? It's <b>his</b>.</i>

00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:57.266
<i><b>Whose</b> books are these? They're <b>theirs</b>.</i>

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:13.233
<i><b>Whose</b> ruler is that? It's <b>his</b>.</i>